{"id":"elas","lemma":"elas","pos":"pron","rank":234,"glosses":["they (a group of people other than the speaker, entirely female)","third-person feminine plural personal pronoun used in all positions; they; them; it"],"ipa":"/ˈɛ.lɐs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/Pt-br-elas.ogg/Pt-br-elas.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Elas me querem.","en":"They want me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/471682","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"}]},{"text":"Elas sabem disso.","en":"They know that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/967339","words":[null,{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},null]},{"text":"Quem são elas?","en":"Who are they?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/351533","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Onde estão elas?","en":"Where are they?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844372","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Elas acreditam nisso.","en":"They believe it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/470374","words":[null,{"g":"to believe","l":"acreditar"},null]}]}